---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import profile from "../assets/profile.jpeg";
---

<section id="about" class="section">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <Image
      class="profile"
      src={profile}
      alt="Two smiling hikers in toques on a forest trail beside a waterfall"
      width={480}
      widths={[240, 480]}
      sizes="200px"
      style="object-position: 32% center"
    />
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>
      I taught myself to knit in 2018 when raising my twin boys slowed down.
      After seeing a beautiful cable knit toque in a store, I wanted to make
      one. I probably should have started with something beginner friendly. I
      ended up with some odd-looking toques. I've learned a lot over the years,
      but still make some questionable knitwear. I love knitting, and it's
      become a bit of an addiction, so I decided to sell my creations. I hope
      others will enjoy them as much as I enjoy making them.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
